  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, bring the water (for the rice) to boil.\n• Add basmati rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 10 mins, then remove pan from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b735655369cbcaefd20471/step-67e14d00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, boil the kettle.\n• Half-fill a small saucepan with boiling water.\n• Add the eggs and cook until hard-boiled, 10 mins.\n• Using tongs, remove eggs from saucepan and cool in cold water. Carefully peel eggs.\n• While the eggs are boiling, cut paneer into 2cm chunks.\n• Finely chop brown onion (see ingredients) and tomato.\n• Thinly slice long chilli (if using).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b735655369cbcaefd20471/step-de231d10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion and tomato, until tender, 5-6 mins.\n• Add mild curry paste and cook until fragrant, 1-2 mins.\n• Add the water (for the curry), paneer, eggs and a pinch of sugar. Cover with a lid and simmer until slightly thickened, 3-4 mins.\n• Remove pan from heat and stir through Greek-style yoghurt. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b735655369cbcaefd20471/step-92408520.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice eggs in half and return to curry.\n• Divide basmati rice between bowls and top with fragrant paneer and egg curry.\n• Sprinkle over chilli and tear over coriander to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b735655369cbcaefd20471/step-d3644830.jpg"
    }
  ]
